(hierarchical_label "H2" (shape passive) (at 92.71 121.92 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "c4e67b3c-3792-47b2-87cb-68d2e86400bb"))
(text "NOT_N16: Y1 = ~A1, Y2 = ~A2. One 6N16B (6Н16Б): two independent inverters, each triode with its own Ra.\nInputs A1, A2: LV level, straight to the grids (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V).\nOutputs Y1, Y2: HV level on the plates (1 = +150 V, 0 = +50 V).\nSimulated: Y = 147 / 55 V; fanout 2/10: tpHL 61/83 ns, tpLH 64/211 ns; crosstalk between the halves -2 / +5 V.\nEach HV net that drives grids needs a divider HV -> LV: 470k || C1 from Y to the LV net,\n200k from the LV net to -50 V, C1 = 3.9 pF per grid on that net (see NOT_N16_tb).\nLV inputs must come from such a divider (grid current is limited by it), never from a stiff source.\nUnused half: tie its input to a used LV net or to the other input. Supplies: +150 V, -50 V (dividers only),\nheater 6.3 V 0.4 A on H1/H2. Page: sch/logic/NOT_N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "376d873b-8820-4e2f-a852-6be3dde005aa"))

